  - m_Id: 1353981982
    m_Localized: A new colony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981983
    m_Localized: Now it's up to you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981984
    m_Localized: Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981985
    m_Localized: Got it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981986
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981987
    m_Localized: Let's grow!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981988
    m_Localized: Show objective
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981989
    m_Localized: Skip tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981990
    m_Localized: A new colony begins here. Your queen has five workers to turn this
      small shelter into an anthill. Let's make room and get your colony ready to
      grow!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981991
    m_Localized: Select the digging brush to open new spaces in the anthill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981992
    m_Localized: Click and drag over the indicated soil to mark where your workers
      should dig.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981993
    m_Localized: You mark the path; your workers do the work. Wait until they finish
      digging.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981994
    m_Localized: Now let's give this space a purpose. Select the nutrient brush and
      paint the inside of the area you just dug.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981995
    m_Localized: Here, your workers will cultivate fungi to produce nutrients. They
      sustain the colony's growth and let you invest in new areas and upgrades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981996
    m_Localized: The colony needs new generations to grow. Use the digging brush
      to open one more chamber connected to the anthill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981997
    m_Localized: Select the nursery brush and paint the new space. There, your workers
      will tend to the brood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981998
    m_Localized: With a working nursery and available nutrients, your queen reproduces
      automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353981999
    m_Localized: Eggs go through the larva and pupa stages until they become new
      ants. Your workers look after this development.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982000
    m_Localized: Your colony can go further! Open the evolution tree to see your
      possibilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982001
    m_Localized: Use nutrients to unlock skills and upgrades. The anthill tree develops
      the colony; the queen tree improves her abilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982002
    m_Localized: Check each skill's effect, cost and requirements before choosing
      where to invest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982003
    m_Localized: 'But be careful: enemies may arrive and threaten your anthill. Your
      ants will have to fight to defend the colony.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982004
    m_Localized: 'Strengthen your colony and prepare your defenses. Protect the queen:
      the anthill''s survival depends on her!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982005
    m_Localized: Your small anthill has a great future ahead. Expand the tunnels,
      care for the new generations and strengthen your colony. Now it's up to you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982006
    m_Localized: Initial laying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982007
    m_Localized: With the nursery ready, the queen lays 1 egg every 18 s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982008
    m_Localized: Faster laying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982009
    m_Localized: The queen lays an egg every 12 s instead of 18 s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982010
    m_Localized: Batch laying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982011
    m_Localized: Up to 3 eggs per laying, if there is food and nursery space
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982012
    m_Localized: Worker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982013
    m_Localized: Does every basic task in the colony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982014
    m_Localized: Larger load
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982015
    m_Localized: Workers carry 3 plant pieces instead of 2 and 4 soil instead of
      3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982016
    m_Localized: Fast movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982017
    m_Localized: Workers walk 25% faster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982018
    m_Localized: Rescuing nestmates
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982019
    m_Localized: Workers rescue buried nestmates near the tunnel edge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982020
    m_Localized: Carrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982021
    m_Localized: 'New class: carries 4 plant pieces per trip and walks 17% faster
      than a worker'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353982022
    m_Localized: Bigger loads
    m_Metadata:
