    m_Localized: 'Nursery: carry the eggs and tend the brood.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564844
    m_Localized: 'Nutrient room: build beds, water them and tend what sprouts.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564845
    m_Localized: 'Dew drops: loose soil on the ceiling and care of the drops.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316986959564846
    m_Localized: 'Waste: dismember dead termites and carry the remains away.'
